01:31:48.354 --> 01:31:51.265
now a 12 nonresident round-trip vehicle trip per day standard.

01:31:54.180 --> 01:31:58.045
That's a discussion for another time with our home occupation code. In my

01:31:58.545 --> 01:32:02.103
