do a stakeout. In this case, the ARL zone, for whatever

01:32:19.100 --> 01:32:22.739
reason, has that number deleted, but still gives the

01:32:23.239 --> 01:32:25.403
objective of having small-scale, low-intensity operations.

01:32:33.885 --> 01:32:37.633
Comparative similarities in animals and fencing

01:32:37.923 --> 01:32:41.400
to a certain extent and the desire to preserve the dark sky

01:32:41.513 --> 01:32:44.826
ordinance and keep natural

01:32:45.326 --> 01:32:48.736
habitat standards as listed in both codes the same on the books.

01:32:49.784 --> 01:32:50.415
Or proposed.

01:32:53.571 --> 01:32:57.553
Now, maybe the folks that are here would like to try and characterize farther some

